<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mahakal Puzzle Battle - महाकाल पजल बैटल</title>

<style>
body {
background-color: #0b0f19;
color: #ffffff;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
text-align: center;
margin: 0;
padding: 10px;
user-select: none;
}
.container {
max-width: 420px;
margin: auto;
background: #131a26;
padding: 15px;
border-radius: 12px;
border: 2px solid #ff7b00;
box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 123, 0, 0.3);
position: relative;
}
h2 { color: #ffab00; margin-top: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px; }

.banner-img {
width: 100%;
max-height: 200px;
object-fit: cover;
border-radius: 8px;
border: 1px solid #ffab00;
margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.btn {
background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff7b00, #ffaa00);
color: white;
border: none;
padding: 12px;
width: 100%;
border-radius: 6px;
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: bold;
cursor: pointer;
margin-top: 10px;
}
.btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

input, select {
width: 90%;
padding: 10px;
margin: 8px 0;
background: #1a2332;
border: 1px solid #444;
color: white;
border-radius: 5px;
text-align: center;
font-size: 14px;
}

.wallet-box {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c1a00, #4d2600);
padding: 12px;
border-radius: 8px;
margin-bottom: 12px;
border: 1px solid #ffcc00;
font-size: 14px;
}

.card-box {
background: #1a2332;
border: 1px solid #334155;
border-radius: 8px;
padding: 12px;
margin: 10px 0;
text-align: left;
}

.qr-img {
width: 150px;
height: 150px;
background: white;
padding: 6px;
border-radius: 6px;
margin: 8px auto;
display: block;
border: 2px solid #ffab00;
}

.admin-panel {
background: #2a1a1a;
border: 2px solid #ff5252;
padding: 12px;
border-radius: 8px;
margin-top: 15px;
text-align: left;
display: none;
font-size: 12px;
}
.hidden { display: none !important; }
.msg { color: #00e676; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
.error { color: #ff5252; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

<!-- SECRET ADMIN TRIGGER (Title par 3 baar click karein, Password: 78699) -->
<h2 onclick="checkSecretAdminTap()">🔱 MAHAKAL PUZZLE BATTLE 🔱</h2>

<!-- Banner image file -->
<img src="3438.png" alt="Mahakal Puzzle Battle Banner" class="banner-img">

<!---------------- 1. LOGIN PAGE SECTION ---------------->
<div id="login-section">
<div class="card-box" style="text-align: center;">
<h3 style="color: #ffab00; margin-top: 0; font-size: 16px;">🔐 लॉगिन करें & ₹199 बोनस पाएं</h3>
<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #aaa;">खेलने के लिए अपना मोबाइल नंबर और पासवर्ड दर्ज करें:</p>
<input type="tel" id="login-phone" placeholder="10 अंकों का मोबाइल नंबर" maxlength="10">
<input type="password" id="login-pass" placeholder="पासवर्ड दर्ज करें">
<button class="btn" onclick="processLogin()">लॉगिन करें (Login)</button>
